<title>INDIA: India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 10.36 percent.</title>
<headline>India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 10.36 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund said on Tuesday the yield on its money market mutual fund (MMMF) as on July 08 was 10.36 percent.</p>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund is a joint venture between India's Kothari Group and U.S. mutual fund Pioneer Inc.</p>
<p>	  The following are the Net Asset Value (NAV) for Kothari</p>
